****************************************
TABLE MAKER v1.2                 / SAMAR
****************************************
This utility could be useful for coders,
who wants to use proportional charset in
 their productions. It converts normal
   fonts into proportional ones, then
 prepares the table with widths of each
  char and allows you to set width of
space. Then you can save converted fonts
into disk and do the same with prepared
  table. Then you have got everything,
   what you need to use proportional
      charset in your productions!
